# Sources of the fkwu runtime and JIT study (r1/runtime-jit). The runtime's C files and the in-language emitter are 2.1.7 to 2.1.14.

n: 2.9
name: runtime-jit-sources
kind: hub
is: Sources cited by the study of the old runtime fkwu and its machine-code emitters, read 2026-11-24: the study report, five documents and four program files of the old body, and ten private working notes. The runtime's C files, its headers and the in-language emitter are cited from 2.1.7 to 2.1.14.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/runtime-jit

n: 2.9.1
name: runtime-jit.md
kind: source
is: The study report on the fkwu runtime and JIT, 525 lines in 15 sections: boot path, value words, node states, machine-code paths, memory, measurements taken on one machine, size by subsystem, caches, a carry-forward list, a let-go list and a bootstrap estimate.
path: coherence-seed/study/r1/runtime-jit.md
date: 2026-11-24
got: 2026-11-24
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/runtime-jit

